<p id="S6.SS3.p4.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS3.p4.5.1" class="ltx_text">and twisting by <math id="S6.SS3.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{O}}_{S}(L)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{O}}_{S}(L)</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</span></p>
