<p id="S6.SS3.p4.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS3.p4.7.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="S6.SS3.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math> is the multiplication map of sections</span></p>
